// Port of jiff-0.2 (the `SignedDuration` subset)
//
// Jiff is a datetime library. It is a dev-dependency of `clap`, used by
// `examples/typed-derive/implicit.rs` for `--sleep <SLEEP>`.
//
//   src/signed_duration.rs      -> signed_duration.baml (SignedDuration)
//   src/fmt/friendly/parser.rs  -> fmt/friendly.baml    (the "friendly" duration format)
